        {
          "id": "79102ac7b61eb7db7a4b9f0a4fc13aa950327f4631bb175ec842412c2fba4d34",
          "text": "此内容属于"
        },
        {
          "id": "0d32b70d9f3044a05e2454f1e3d0969f9cb212144b1250b454d3febb87706269",
          "text": "Go Wiki"
        },
        {
          "id": "76473a5bafd2fc058bedaae717089a35af9f3534672ebff7ce481a3de346c8cc",
          "text": "此文档的源文件可在以下位置找到："
        },
        {
          "id": "f4c4ca13fd775996b06b1f0a7a20ecebf5dd5682d36f7b6a7c203ed03e11e940",
          "text": "报告问题"
        },
        {
          "id": "780342dec3634993f0ad12e7771bbb4ff6751080556793433ea8ad7586dbf4de",
          "text": "如果你在 Go 项目的代码或文档中发现 bug、错误或不一致之处，请通过我们的"
